  "notes": "\n1. Filtered the dataset to include only '大安區, 臺北市' using prep.in_area with the '區域代碼' column.\n2. Excluded AED locations categorized as '學校、大型集會場所' and '其他' as per the problem specification.\n3. Deduplicated locations using prep.merge_same_place (passing arguments positionally to avoid keyword errors) based on '場所名稱', '緯度', and '經度' to ensure one record per physical site.\n4. To satisfy the hard constraint of equal group sizes (N/3), removed (N mod 3) locations from the final set.\n5. Computed the straight-line distance matrix using prep.haversine_matrix and converted it to a sparse format [site_i, site_j, distance].\n",
